      "text": "收录：Cubox card 7450104523311284302",
      "x": -79,
      "y": -665,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "2",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n4",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 风险提示\n- 原文来自社交媒体个人分析，非机构研报。\n- \"版本强势英雄\"是游戏化语言，不能作为投资依据。",
      "x": 563,
      "y": -287,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "3",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n5",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\"求导\"逻辑可能遗漏关键中间环节，越长的链条不确定性越高。",
      "x": 789,
      "y": -451,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "3",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n6",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "本页价值在“生成研究假设”，不是“证明投资结论”。",
      "x": 887,
      "y": -379,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "3",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n7",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 原文\n",
      "x": 702,
      "y": 102,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "4",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n8",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 产业链推导路线\n- ```\n- 算力租赁",
      "x": 312,
      "y": 414,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "5",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n9",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "→ 半导体",
      "x": 535,
      "y": 579,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "5",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n10",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 被标记为\"版本强势英雄\"的环节\n- 环节 / 逻辑锚点 / 需核验\n- 六氟磷酸锂 / 储能→电池→电解液 / 供需、价格趋势",
      "x": -312,
      "y": 414,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "6",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n11",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "隔膜 / 电池关键材料 / 竞争格局",
      "x": -394,
      "y": 619,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "6",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n12",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "电子特气（氦气、六氟化钨） / 半导体上游材料 / 国产替代率",
      "x": -535,
      "y": 579,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "6",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n13",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 核心逻辑链评价\n- \"求导\"思维——从最终需求（AI算力）逐层推导到最上游（材料、能源）\n- 把\"算电协同\"和\"土地财政转型\"结合起来，是宏观视角",
      "x": -702,
      "y": 102,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "7",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n14",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\"求导\"逻辑只是线索，不等同于投资逻辑",
      "x": -1027,
      "y": 192,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "7",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n15",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "六氟磷酸锂、电子特气等是周期品，价格波动大",
      "x": -1062,
      "y": 103,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "7",
      "styleAttributes": {
